# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend build output (Next.js export → copy-next-export.mjs → static/frontend).
# Orval client under hpcperfstats/site/frontend/src/api/generated/ is gitignored
# (run npm run generate:api before typecheck/test/build). Never commit static tree.
# Produce locally: cd hpcperfstats/site/frontend && npm ci && npm run build
# Docker: Dockerfile frontend-builder runs npm run build and copies into the image.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
hpcperfstats/site/hpcperfstats_site/static/frontend/
scripts/unlazy*
